; VDH Media Center - language file (Vietnamese)
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------
; English is built into the program, so it needs no file. Every other
; language is one .lng file in this "lang" folder.
;
; Every translation line has this form:
;       "original English text" = "translated text"
;  - Do NOT change the text on the left: it is the lookup key.
;  - Keep placeholders such as {1} {2} and the \n marker (new line).
;  - In menu items and buttons "&" marks the Alt+letter shortcut.
;  - Lines beginning with ; are comments. Save the file as UTF-8.
;  - A missing line is harmless: the program falls back to English.
;  - @Name is this language's name written in ITSELF; @English is its name in English.
;    The language list in Settings shows each language name translated through the
;    lines "English" = "..." / "<@English value>" = "..." at the end of this file.
;
; To add a new language: copy this file, change @Name below, translate
; only the RIGHT-hand side of each line, and save it as lang\<name>.lng.
; It then appears automatically in Settings > General > Language.
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------
@Name = Tiếng Việt
@English = Vietnamese
@Code = vi

